{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 16,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Promise of Rest"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, since a promise remains of entering His rest, let us fear lest any of you seem to have come short of it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For indeed the gospel was preached to us as well as to them; but the word which they heard did not profit them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M since they were not united by faith with those who heeded it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "not being mixed with faith in those who heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we who have believed do enter that rest, as He has said:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“So I swore in My wrath,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "‘They shall not enter My rest,’ ”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "although the works were finished from the foundation of the world. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For He has spoken in a certain place of the seventh "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in this way: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“And God rested on the seventh day from all His works”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and again in this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "place:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“They shall not enter My rest.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Since therefore it remains that some "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "must"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " enter it, and those to whom it was first preached did not enter because of disobedience, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "again He designates a certain day, saying in David, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Today,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " after such a long time, as it has been said:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Today, if you will hear His voice,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Do not harden your hearts.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. Jesus, same as Heb. Joshua"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Joshua had given them rest, then He would not afterward have spoken of another day. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There remains therefore a rest for the people of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he who has entered His rest has himself also ceased from his works as God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "did"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from His."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Word Discovers Our Condition"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let us therefore be diligent to enter that rest, lest anyone fall according to the same example of disobedience. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the word of God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " living and powerful, and sharper than any two-edged sword, piercing even to the division of soul and spirit, and of joints and marrow, and is a discerner of the thoughts and intents of the heart. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And there is no creature hidden from His sight, but all things "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " naked and open to the eyes of Him to whom we "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "must give"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " account."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Our Compassionate High Priest"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Seeing then that we have a great High Priest who has passed through the heavens, Jesus the Son of God, let us hold fast "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "our"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " confession. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we do not have a High Priest who cannot sympathize with our weaknesses, but was in all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "points"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tempted as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "we are,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "yet"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " without sin. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let us therefore come boldly to the throne of grace, that we may obtain mercy and find grace to help in time of need."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}